<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In God’s own presence now for us</l><l>The Savior doth appear;</l><l>The saints, as jewels on His heart,</l><l>Jesus doth ever bear.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>“No condemnation!” O my soul,</l><l>’Tis God that speaks the word;</l><l>Perfect in comeliness art thou</l><l>In Christ, the risen Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Teach me, O God, to fix mine eyes</l><l>On Christ, the spotless Lamb,</l><l>So shall I love Thy precious will,</l><l>And glorify His name.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
